+      "After Oct. 18, voters can register at the office of their local election authority under the guidelines of grace period registration."],
+    DC: ["TUESDAY, NOVEMBER 3, 2026 – GENERAL ELECTION DAY\nqualified electors may register to vote and cast full ballots in person at Vote Centers.",
